# UI design (this product)

This is a mobile-first PWA (Shadcn + Tailwind), not a marketing landing by default.

- **App / dashboard / boards:** preserve the existing design system and patterns. Prefer consistency over reinvention.
- **New screens or visual identity work:** use skills `frontend-design` and `web-design-guidelines`.
- **Marketing / promotional surfaces only:** distinctive brand-first composition; avoid generic AI template looks (purple gradients, cream+serif+terracotta defaults, fake newspaper layouts). One job per section; don't card-wash the UI.
- Do not apply full landing-page hero rules to authenticated app chrome.
